# Agent tooling. `.claude/skills/*` are symlinks *to directories*; vsce enumerates them as
# files and its secret scanner then read()s them, which fails with EISDIR and aborts the
# package. None of this belongs in a VSIX regardless.
.claude/**
.agents/**
skills-lock.json

# Scratch screenshots taken while working on the page. Referenced by nothing.
board.png

# Working notes for contributors and coding agents. README.md and CHANGELOG.md still ship,
# because the marketplace renders those; these four are internal and were only being packaged
# by accident.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
PROGRESS.md
HANDOFF.md
TODO.md

# Upstream's demo GIFs, which were the whole size of the extension. Nothing embeds them - the
# readme only mentions the folder in passing - so shipping them cost 1.4 MB for no benefit.
doc/**
